From: Iscle <albertiscle9@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 13:14:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Make the display client's AIDL libraries available to the
 platform

crosvm's gpu_display crate links libcrosvm_android_display_client, so a
platform binary built on crosvm's devices crate needs these too.

Change-Id: I266330b34f3f783b56a0f234f50be86fcf2e997a
---
 android/virtualizationservice/aidl/Android.bp | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/android/virtualizationservice/aidl/Android.bp b/android/virtualizationservice/aidl/Android.bp
index 4baf67dac..12a6cad4e 100644
--- a/android/virtualizationservice/aidl/Android.bp
+++ b/android/virtualizationservice/aidl/Android.bp
@@ -22,6 +22,7 @@ aidl_interface {
         },
         ndk: {
             apex_available: [
+                "//apex_available:platform",
                 "com.android.virt",
                 "com.android.compos",
             ],
@@ -65,6 +66,7 @@ aidl_interface {
         },
         ndk: {
             apex_available: [
+                "//apex_available:platform",
                 "com.android.virt",
             ],
         },
@@ -148,6 +150,7 @@ aidl_interface {
         },
         ndk: {
             apex_available: [
+                "//apex_available:platform",
                 "com.android.virt",
                 "com.android.compos",
             ],
